# PMK-NEXUS environment variables.
# Copy this file to .env.local for development. NEVER commit real values (.env* is git-ignored).
#
# NEXUS uses the SAME Supabase project as PI-CORE (same login, separate schema `nexus`).
# Local values: start the PI-CORE local stack, then run `supabase status` inside the PI-CORE
# repository. The API URL is normally http://127.0.0.1:54321. Copy the publishable (anon) key from there.
# Production values: Supabase dashboard > Project Settings > API (see docs/ops/).

# Public values (shipped to the browser; access is limited by Row Level Security):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ============================================================================
# WARNING: NEVER add the service role / secret key here, in Vercel, or anywhere in NEXUS.
# It bypasses ALL security and would expose PI-CORE member data. NEXUS must run only with the
# public key plus the logged-in user's session, so Row Level Security always applies.
# ============================================================================
